# 20. Optional: Deploy a More Realistic Website

You can also have multiple files:

```text
docker-web-deployment/
│
├── Dockerfile
└── web/
    ├── index.html
    ├── style.css
    └── script.js
```

Then the Dockerfile becomes:

```dockerfile
FROM nginx:alpine

COPY web/ /usr/share/nginx/html/

EXPOSE 80
```

This is better for a larger web application because Docker copies the complete website into Nginx.

